{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9NeSUyMExpZmUlMjBJbiUyMENoaW5hJTIwJTI4MjAxNCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"My Life In China","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nTI5G5RSQQKZUY98OIwKluDGlLE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/649upIlEA0cr24AV3nRNrVeRIOH.jpg","description":"In America, everyone has a family story of immigration. Every family, at some point, has had somebody leave their native country behind to search for a better life. How did they hold onto their identity? How did they adapt to their new life? Every family has a special story. In my case, it's my Chinese-American story. My father would always tell us his story about walking for 7 days and 6 nights, before swimming for 4 hours to Macau to escape communism in 1966. His story would fall on my deaf ears until I returned to China with him.\n\nReleased 9 Nov 2014 · United States of America · Language: Chinese · 81 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Chinese","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["Documentary","Others"],"imdbRating":"9.0","runtime":"81 min","cast":["Yau King Eng"],"director":["Kenneth Eng"],"released":"2014-11-09T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Every American story starts somewhere else.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Kenneth Eng","character":"Director"},{"name":"Yau King Eng"}]},"writer":["Ehren Parks"],"country":"United States of America","language":"Chinese","links":[{"name":"Yau King Eng","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Yau%20King%20Eng"},{"name":"Kenneth Eng","category":"Director","url":"stremio:///search?search=Kenneth%20Eng"},{"name":"Ehren Parks","category":"Writer","url":"stremio:///search?search=Ehren%20Parks"},{"name":"Documentary","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///search?search=Documentary"},{"name":"I Am Heath Ledger","category":"More like this","url":"stremio:///detail/movie/dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE3L0klMjBBbSUyMEhlYXRoJTIwTGVkZ2VyJT